 e and whether it improves symptoms of MDD when taken with your current ant
 idepressant medication(s).\n\nTo find out more\, please contact the Depres
 sion Research Clinic:\n   Maureen Chang\n   650-725-4620\n   mhchang@stanf
 or\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://med.stanford.edu/drc/research.html\n
